e literally about to get bodied  by morris get it bodied because he was  using the bodies of those devils to  attack them anyway morris is aware that  at least two of the black bulls have  arcane stage magic and the others have  very interesting magic as well because  of this morris can't wait to dissect  them all and perform experiments on them  because you know that's just a normal  everyday mad scientist thing morris uses  all of that devil flesh around him to  create massive claws which he then uses  to swipe at the black bulls vanessa  tries to use the red thread of fate to  negate morris attacks but morris implies  that because of his new devil power up  his magic is now capable of interfering  even with concepts also if he so much as  touches the black bulls they will be  done for now i'm not 100 sure what  morris means when he says that his magic  can interfere even with concepts i  assume he means that his magic is able  to take on not just conventional magic  but also abstract magical concepts like  the red thread of fate i wonder if this  means that morris will be able to  counter asta's anti-magic as well so far  anti-magic has been super effective  against devils but it's only a matter of  time before asta comes face to face with  an opponent who has an effective way of  dealing with anti-magic morris may be  that opponent and as the rest of this  chapter demonstrates we will find out  whether morris is that opponent very  soon as morris's giant demonic claw  things rush towards the black bulls gray  uses her incredible transformation magic  to transform the demonic arms into a  bunch of pretty flowers we then learn  through a flashback that grey's true  magic is something more than just  transformation magic transformation  magic is supposed to only change how  things look it changes their appearance  not their fundamental structure however  grey's magic has the potential to change  the very structure of things so rather  than being conventional transformation  magic it is more accurately called  transmutation magic man as soon as i saw  this it instantly reminded me of full  metal alchemist and personally i think  that this revelation about grey's magic  is very cool transmutation magic has so  much potential and i can't wait to see  all the ways that she is going to use it  in the future morris is impressed by  gray's abilities but rather than slowing  down he only accelerates his attacks on  the black bulls meanwhile gray is being  all nervous because she's next to gosh  and she's totally into him but gauche is  all chill and he just says shut up for  now and look at me damn i know gauche is  saying this because of his magic and  everything but it really sounds like  he's dropping some lines on grey as a  blushing grey looks at gauche he  activates his mirror magic and suddenly  a bunch of grey shadow clones appear  these clones are able to transmute the  rest of morse's attacks into flowers  allowing the black bulls to deal with  the increased number of attacks morris  who is now hilariously surrounded by  pretty flowers decides that now is the  time to use his other magic the one that  belongs to his devil lucifer morris  activates gravity magic presence of the  demon king the same spell that dante was  shown using before gravity should not be  something that grey's magic can  transform so by increasing the gravity  in that area morris can essentially  disassemble the black bulls and their  mecha headquarters and they can't do  anything to stop him because how do you  stop gravity itself and that is when  none other than henry steps up to the  plate during that earlier battle against  dante when yami was kidnapped henry felt  like he couldn't do a thing but this  time things are going to be different  that's because henry and gordon figured  something out together we see a  flashback in which gordon returns from 6  months of intense training with his  family during this training he learned  how to turn his poison into medicine he  is now able to turn curses into power  which allows henry to control the  effects of his curse  so instead of uncontrollably absorbing  magic from everyone around him henry is  now able to choose from where the magic  he drains is going to come from and of  course he decides to start draining  morris's magic henry also gets a haircut  for some reason like right then and  there in the middle of the fight he has  long hair one second and then short hair  the next i'm not exactly sure why this  happened but okay let's go with it  morris is shocked to find himself being  drained of his magic despite the fact  that he is supposed to be the one with  the strongest power and if that wasn't  bad enough for morris osta and the other  black bulls used that giant hole in  order to join up with grey gauche  vanessa gordon and henry but morris  remains defiant he has completed  countless experiments in order to turn  himself into the perfect devil host and  now with the power of lucifer behind him  he cannot be defeated at least that's  what he claims  but whether morris is the ultimate devil  host or just a mage from the diamond  kingdom means nothing to the black bulls  they are here to save their captain and  they won't let anyone or anything stand  in their way the final page of the  chapter shows an absolutely epic panel  of the black bulls assembled and ready  to face morris together osta is there  noel is there magna zora lux secret  finral charmy everyone is ready to go  they demand the return of their captain  and that is how this chapter ends the  black bulls are assembled in one place  for the first time in a very long time  our boy asta is there of course and i'm  sure noct is also there somewhere he  might be up to something but we'll have  to wait and see this means that the  final battle is upon us the final fight  for yami's life is here and even though  i personally believe that yami will be  successfully rescued soon rescuing yami  may n